    {
      "text": "Thou shalt not follow a multitude to do evil, Ex. 23:2. Caleb … and Joshua … have wholly followed the Lord, Num. 32:12 (14:34; Josh. 14:8). return from following after thee, Ruth 1:16. none that followed the house of David, 1 Kgs. 12:20. if the Lord be God, follow him, 1 Kgs. 18:21. Surely goodness and mercy shall follow me, Ps. 23:6. he that followeth vain persons is void of understanding, Prov. 12:11. Hearken to me, ye that follow after righteousness, Isa. 51:1.",
